m ring and Taylor map. True whole Taylor naturality for the actual zero-direction polynomial chart and the formal right inverse give the entire requested target Taylor series. For an actual original target germ, its own positive Taylor mass radius is internally supplied by actual analyticity; actual Taylor injectivity then identifies the analytic pullback itself with the given whole target germ. Conversely genuine analytic pullback naturality and unconditional zero-chart support give the whole cone condition. No original analytic preimage, range compatibility or inverse convergence certificate is a premise.",
